Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty Little Defenders 11 – New Wild Cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}The Colorful Dandelion
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Episode 44
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.38,0:12:36.94,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.39,0:00:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you? How dare you come here and cause trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.63,0:00:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s Pink speaking—come out right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.86,0:00:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.36,0:00:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You can’t escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.51,0:00:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The house is disappearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.43,0:00:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re going to turn back into our original forms.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.79,0:00:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.23,0:00:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.10,0:01:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That is…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.42,0:01:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Her power has weakened—let’s take her down in one go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.22,0:01:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Darn it…without the fragments, I don’t have enough power.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.98,0:01:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn’t she…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.34,0:01:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t let me see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.46,0:01:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,So it was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.97,0:01:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Tibbie.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.11,0:01:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Jonie.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.19,0:01:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re okay—thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.31,0:01:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,She’s the one who was fighting us for the fragment earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.31,0:01:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is she here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.74,0:01:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Did she turn the entire castle into flower petals?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.54,0:01:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.47,0:01:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,This castle was originally part of Young Lady’s body.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.87,0:01:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Young Lady…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.39,0:01:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You are…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.23,0:01:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,the furniture from before?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.58,0:01:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What is going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.78,0:01:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Young Lady created this castle to protect us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.00,0:01:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We had been serving Young Lady all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.92,0:01:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But then, one day, something went wrong with the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.95,0:01:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It was only because Young Lady used her energy to create this castle…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.11,0:01:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,that we managed to survive until now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.80,0:02:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,No wonder they lost their color whenever they left the castle, or even vanished.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.03,0:02:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth has happened to your world?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.07,0:02:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you saying so much to these outsiders?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.79,0:02:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,They are the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.33,0:02:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Give back what you’re holding right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.92,0:02:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Then give Mr. Slowy back to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.24,0:02:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I try to take it by force?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.64,0:02:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But without the power of the fragment…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.08,0:02:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m no match for them right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.02,0:02:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though I’ve managed to preserve the dandelion for the moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.69,0:02:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,the power will fail the moment they leave my range.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.17,0:02:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I do? Am I forced to agree to their demands?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.05,0:02:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll pretend to agree for now, then find a way to snatch the dandelion back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.40,0:02:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, I agree to take you to find this “Mr. Slowy”.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.84,0:02:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Young Miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.32,0:02:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys wait here for me to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.80,0:02:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s get this straight: I’m only showing the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.60,0:02:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we get there, you have to give the dandelion back to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.04,0:02:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We keep our word.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.12,0:02:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I never expected them to uncover Pink’s secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.12,0:02:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The fragments from the Xilan Tree have fallen into enemy hands, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.11,0:02:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,See? We Mighty Little Defenders are pretty amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.07,0:02:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe Sparky will be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.19,0:03:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m going to rescue Pink.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.39,0:03:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to go; just stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.70,0:03:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I think Pink will find a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.04,0:03:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You outsiders…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.48,0:03:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,know nothing about the dangers of this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.90,0:03:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.18,0:03:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you suddenly laugh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.66,0:03:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought of something happy. Let’s go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.03,0:03:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Now’s the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.01,0:03:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,My face…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.48,0:03:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.72,0:04:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop nagging. Mind your own business.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.87,0:04:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The path ahead is blocked. Should we go this way instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.12,0:04:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that’s right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.20,0:04:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to get through.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.88,0:04:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But it doesn’t look like we can get through.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.04,0:04:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Now’s my chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.80,0:04:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You aren’t tricking us, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.51,0:04:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for clearing the way for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.47,0:04:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.03,0:04:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse to believe you’ll get lucky every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.48,0:04:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Try the power of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.64,0:04:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll turn into petals to dodge—just wait until you get hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.31,0:04:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and ram into me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.25,0:04:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.81,0:04:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a close call.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.25,0:04:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it really was.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.49,0:04:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m not giving up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.48,0:05:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The water is shallow here; let’s go this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.84,0:05:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.99,0:05:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You should come over here too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.11,0:05:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,C-coming right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.31,0:05:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If we take a shortcut here and keep going, we’ll be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.18,0:05:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let’s hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.78,0:05:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Why have I been hurting myself after all this effort?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.14,0:05:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve never been so humiliated.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.15,0:05:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Pink.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.99,0:05:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop playing games.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.70,0:05:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you haven’t been genuinely guiding us this whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.62,0:05:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.82,0:05:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I hid it so well—I didn’t expect you to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.15,0:05:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You weren’t hiding it at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.22,0:05:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We really need to rescue Mr. Slowy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.54,0:05:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s just as urgent as your desire to protect the colors of this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.30,0:06:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.09,0:06:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We really want to save Mr. Slowy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.65,0:06:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m not going to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.08,0:06:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.93,0:06:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,If you dare hurt my flower, you’re done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.69,0:06:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Tibbie…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.04,0:06:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,W-w-what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.08,0:06:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Here’s your flower back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.20,0:06:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ll go find Mr. Slowy ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.47,0:06:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you have no intention of helping us, we won’t force you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.64,0:06:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You’d better go back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.64,0:06:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The residents you protected are waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.80,0:06:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,They don’t seem that bad, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.95,0:06:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.67,0:06:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You can’t go that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.80,0:07:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.79,0:07:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.07,0:07:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s a linear tornado! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.07,0:07:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s go save her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.07,0:07:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I kept trying to hurt you all—why did you come to save me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.15,0:07:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Because we felt you had your reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.26,0:07:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t act like you know me so well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.86,0:07:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though I don’t know much about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.78,0:07:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,in your paintings,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.54,0:07:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I can feel your love for the world
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.54,0:07:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,and your longing for a beautiful life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.43,0:07:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Every one of your paintings
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.71,0:08:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,is filled with hope for a beautiful world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.44,0:08:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,My flower…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.32,0:08:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,No…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.92,0:08:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Pink…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.16,0:08:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The color I’ve always guarded is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.48,0:08:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Our home is gone, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.12,0:08:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Pink…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.51,0:08:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Jonie…Lend me your gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.72,0:08:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.15,0:08:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll definitely help you get it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.15,0:09:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Reverse Punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.88,0:09:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Tibbie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.37,0:09:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Colorful Dandelion.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.49,0:09:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But this is all that’s left.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.36,0:09:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for helping me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.88,0:09:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.89,0:09:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The dandelion has returned to its original state.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.73,0:09:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s even more beautiful than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.08,0:09:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s just as beautiful as the dandelions in your painting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.68,0:09:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t know what caused it to return to normal,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.98,0:09:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,but I know I see hope now. Thank you both.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.37,0:09:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you find true strength,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.85,0:09:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,instead of relying on the power of the fragments.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.46,0:09:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.62,0:10:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re off to rescue Mr. Slowy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.97,0:10:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.29,0:10:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s the direction you need to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.61,0:10:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me show you the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.58,0:10:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy—the one you’re looking for—is in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.82,0:10:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,But rescuing him from Peach won’t be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.17,0:10:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what, we’re going to rescue Mr. Slowy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.57,0:10:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.53,0:10:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you let them come here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.65,0:10:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Brown, they might not be our enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.00,0:10:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,They might even help us find a way to save this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.45,0:10:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re planning to side with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.65,0:10:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going to betray us?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.24,0:10:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I won’t let you in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.64,0:10:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We just want to save Mr. Slowy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.25,0:10:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is Sparky? What did you do to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.17,0:11:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t tell me Sparky…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.24,0:11:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That weakling?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.40,0:11:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Bottomless Abyss
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.42,0:11:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Bottomless Abyss is the most dangerous place around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.42,0:11:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you fall into the Bottomless Abyss, there is no coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.37,0:11:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,How could this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.57,0:11:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky wouldn’t be defeated so easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.43,0:11:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let me recreate exactly how he was defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.99,0:11:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve never been defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.10,0:11:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.18,0:11:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn’t you fall into the Bottomless Abyss?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.42,0:11:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you still here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.62,0:11:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,There is nothing in this world that can stump me, Sparky.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.98,0:11:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Including defeating you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.21,0:11:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You arrogant fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.37,0:11:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry and go save Mr. Slowy, I’ll bring up the rear this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.01,0:11:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.29,0:11:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry; I’m not the same person I was back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.41,0:11:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We believe in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.57,0:12:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,None of you are getting in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.97,0:12:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,We haven’t truly settled the score between us yet.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
